 "remarks": "Welcome to this bright and spacious unit in the desirable Northstar building, ideally located in the heart of Downtown Stamford. Offering an open and airy layout, this residence features beautiful views, abundant natural light, and a private balcony accessible from the living room and both bedrooms.  The open-concept living and dining area features sliding glass doors leading to the balcony, creating a seamless connection to the outdoors. The updated kitchen is equipped with stainless steel appliances, ample cabinetry, and a separate laundry room for added convenience.  The primary bedroom offers generous custom closet space, direct balcony access, and a private full bathroom with updated vanity. The second bedroom also enjoys balcony access and features a walk-in closet with built-in shelving, along with convenient access to the second full bathroom with updated vanity.  Enjoy comfortable city living just moments from the restaurants, shopping, entertainment, all the conveniences Downtown Stamford has to offer and 1 mile to the Stamford Train Station which is a 50 minute ride to NYC! A wonderful opportunity to enjoy space, privacy, and an unbeatable location!",
